WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.041
Today your child listens to the other end of the word. The last sound.

2
00:00:04.491 --> 00:00:11.303
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.382
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:19.128
The end of a word is harder to hear than the start. So say the word slowly.

5
00:00:19.578 --> 00:00:22.735
The last sound is the last thing your mouth does. Listen.

6
00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:24.248
The word is bus.

7
00:00:25.905 --> 00:00:26.903
The word is fan.

8
00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:29.724
The word is cat.

9
00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:37.460
If your child says the first sound again, that is the usual slip. Say the word once more, and hold the end.

10
00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.995
Your child says the last sound of the six pictures in job one, and marks each box.

11
00:00:43.445 --> 00:00:50.191
In job two, your child circles the picture that ends like the first one. Then checks the answers upside down.

12
00:00:50.641 --> 00:00:54.202
At the end, your child says the last sound of three pictures for you.
